106.135 Alternative Security Program.
An OCS facility owner or operator may use an Alternative Security Program approved under
§ 101.120 of this subchapter
if:
(
a
)
The Alternative Security Program is appropriate to that OCS facility;
(
b
)
The OCS facility does not serve vessels on international voyages; and
(
c
)
The Alternative Security Program is implemented in its entirety.

